      "description": "Kendall-Jackson Wine Center, Santa Rosa, California, USA\n Kendall-Jackson Wine Center .\nVisiting Sonoma County's wine country is a spectacular experience with exquisite food, gorgeous scenery and fabulous wines. Kendall-Jackson brings the wine country to life at two tasting room locations.\nKendall-Jackson Wine Center is a magnificent château set on 120 acres in the heart of Sonoma County, wine and culinary aficionados gather to experience the charm, romance and flavors of the wine country. Enjoy a seated wine &amp; food pairing, visit the tasting bar, browse for gifts and limited wines, and tour the vineyards and extensive flower, herb and vegetable gardens that surround the château.\n\nThe Healdsburg Tasting Room is just off the square in the quaint stylish town of Healdsburg. Our tasting room offers visitors the complete Kendall-Jackson portfolio of wines.",
